{"seq":1,"slug":"sensors-and-iot","title":"深地传感与物联网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/smart-operations-frontiers/sensors-and-iot","wordCount":1627,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"深地传感与物联网\">深地传感与物联网</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>深地空间的感知与通信是实现智能运维的第一道关卡。在千米以下的极端环境中——高温（40~80°C）、高压（&gt;25 MPa）、高湿（&gt;95% RH）、强腐蚀——传统商用传感器和通信设备的可靠性急剧下降。深地传感与物联网技术通过环境适应性设计和组网架构创新，构建覆盖深地空间全域的感知网络，为上层数字孪生和智能决策提供数据基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"深地极端环境传感器\">深地极端环境传感器</h3><p>深地传感器必须在&quot;三高&quot;环境中长期稳定工作，设计约束远超地面应用：</p>\n<p><strong>耐高温传感器</strong></p>\n<p>硅基 MEMS 传感器在 125°C 以上性能退化严重。深地高温传感替代方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碳化硅（SiC）压力传感器：工作温度达 600°C</li>\n<li>蓝宝石光纤法珀传感器：300°C 以上仍保持高精度</li>\n<li>铂电阻温度传感器（Pt100）：标定范围 -200~850°C</li>\n</ul>\n<p>压力传感的量程设计需覆盖围岩应力变化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{range} = (1.2\\sim1.5) \\times \\sigma_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>耐高压封装</strong></p>\n<p>传感器封装需承受静水压力和岩体挤压双重载荷：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>316L 不锈钢壳体：耐压 50 MPa</li>\n<li>哈氏合金 C-276 壳体：耐腐蚀 + 耐压 100 MPa</li>\n<li>陶瓷封装：化学惰性，适用于强酸性环境</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>防水防潮设计</strong></p>\n<p>IP68 防护等级不足以应对深地长期浸泡条件。采用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>气密玻璃-金属封接</li>\n<li>全焊接密封结构</li>\n<li>分子筛内置干燥</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分布式光纤传感技术\">分布式光纤传感技术</h3><p>光纤传感在深地工程中具有独特优势：本质安全（无电火花）、抗电磁干扰、可实现公里级分布式测量、耐高温。</p>\n<p><strong>主要技术原理</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>物理机制</th>\n<th>测量参量</th>\n<th>空间分辨率</th>\n<th>测量距离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FBG</td>\n<td>布拉格波长漂移</td>\n<td>应变/温度</td>\n<td>点式</td>\n<td>数十公里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BOTDA</td>\n<td>布里渊散射</td>\n<td>应变/温度</td>\n<td>0.5~2 m</td>\n<td>50~100 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DTS</td>\n<td>拉曼散射</td>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>1~2 m</td>\n<td>10~30 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAS</td>\n<td>瑞利散射</td>\n<td>振动/声学</td>\n<td>1~10 m</td>\n<td>40~100 km</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>光纤布拉格光栅（FBG）的波长-应变关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\lambda_B = \\lambda_B(1-p_e)\\varepsilon + \\lambda_B(\\alpha_f + \\xi)\\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为布拉格波长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为有效弹光系数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 0.22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.22</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为热膨胀系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 为热光系数。</p>\n<p><strong>深地工程应用场景</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>巷道围岩变形监测：沿锚杆布设 FBG 阵列，实时测量轴力分布</li>\n<li>管片衬砌应力：FBG 传感器预埋于预制管片</li>\n<li>储气库压力/温度场：DTS 沿注采井布设</li>\n<li>微震监测：DAS 替代传统检波器阵列</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"无线地下通信技术\">无线地下通信技术</h3><p>深地环境中电磁波衰减严重，传统 Wi-Fi/4G 信号在岩层中传播距离极为有限。突破深地通信瓶颈的技术路线：</p>\n<p><strong>超低频（VLF/ELF）通信</strong></p>\n<p>电磁波在导电介质中的趋肤深度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mi>μ</mi><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{\\omega\\mu\\sigma_{rock}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.8856em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5544em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8856em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mtext> S/m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{rock} = 0.01\\ \\text{S/m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S/m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的岩体，1 kHz 频率对应趋肤深度约 160 m。降低频率可增大穿透深度，但带宽极窄（bps 级）。</p>\n<p><strong>通穿岩层（Through-The-Earth, TTE）通信</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>磁感应通信：利用低频磁场穿透岩体，适用于应急通信</li>\n<li>中继节点网络：沿巷道每隔 200~500 m 布设中继器</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>有线骨干 + 无线接入混合架构</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;地面数据中心&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;光纤骨干网&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;竖井光缆&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;巷道光纤环网&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;无线接入点 AP&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;移动终端/传感节点&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;有线传感器&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;人员定位标签&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"地面数据中心\"] --&gt; B[\"光纤骨干网\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"竖井光缆\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"巷道光纤环网\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"无线接入点 AP\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"移动终端/传感节点\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"有线传感器\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"人员定位标签\"]</pre><p>深地物联网推荐架构：光纤承担长距离骨干传输，无线（LoRa/ZigBee 矿用版）覆盖末端接入。LoRa 在巷道中的实测传输距离可达 1~3 km（直线巷道），拐弯处需加中继。</p>\n<h3 id=\"深地物联网体系架构\">深地物联网体系架构</h3><p>深地工程物联网按功能分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>感知层</td>\n<td>数据采集</td>\n<td>传感器、RFID、视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>数据传输</td>\n<td>光纤 + LoRa + 以太网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台层</td>\n<td>数据汇聚与管理</td>\n<td>边缘计算 + 时序数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>智能决策</td>\n<td>数字孪生 + AI 分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边缘计算节点</strong>部署于井下关键位置，实现数据预处理和紧急事件本地决策，降低对地面回传带宽的依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≪</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{response}^{edge} \\ll T_{response}^{cloud}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>边缘节点典型配置：工业级 ARM 处理器 + 16GB RAM + 防爆机箱 + UPS 备电（≥ 4h）。</p>\n<p><strong>数据采集频率设计原则</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>结构安全监测（应力、变形）：1~10 Hz</li>\n<li>环境参数（温度、湿度、气体）：0.1~1 Hz</li>\n<li>视频监控：25 fps（关键区域）/ 1 fps（低风险区域）</li>\n<li>微震监测：1000~10000 Hz</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年深地传感与物联网的前沿进展：基于金刚石 NV 色心的量子传感器在深地高温环境中实现了 nT 级磁场分辨率，为超灵敏应力监测开辟新途径；自供电无线传感节点（利用深地温差发电）摆脱了电池更换难题，设计寿命达 20 年；5G-R（矿用 5G 专网）在千米深井中完成测试，下行速率达 800 Mbps，支持高清视频实时回传和远程操控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某深地工程埋深 1200 m，地温 45°C，围岩含水率高。为监测巷道围岩变形，对比 FBG 光纤传感器和电阻应变片的适用性，给出选型建议。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>计算频率为 500 Hz 的电磁波在电导率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = 0.005</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span></span></span></span></span> S/m 的岩体中的趋肤深度，讨论该频率用于地面-井下通信是否可行。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个深地储能洞室（长 200 m，宽 20 m，高 15 m）的物联网覆盖方案，包括传感器种类和数量、通信架构、边缘计算节点部署。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>深地传感器的&quot;标定漂移&quot;问题是什么？在无法频繁人工标定的条件下，如何保证长期测量精度？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比边缘计算和全量上传两种数据处理架构在深地物联网中的优劣，讨论最优的混合方案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>深地传感与物联网技术是深地空间智能化运维的感知基础。耐极端环境传感器解决了&quot;测什么&quot;的问题，分布式光纤传感实现了&quot;在哪测&quot;的全覆盖，无线地下通信和有线-无线混合架构解决了&quot;数据如何回传&quot;的瓶颈。四层物联网体系将感知数据转化为可用信息，为上层数字孪生和 AI 决策提供支撑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深地传感与物联网","id":"深地传感与物联网"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"深地极端环境传感器","id":"深地极端环境传感器"},{"level":3,"text":"分布式光纤传感技术","id":"分布式光纤传感技术"},{"level":3,"text":"无线地下通信技术","id":"无线地下通信技术"},{"level":3,"text":"深地物联网体系架构","id":"深地物联网体系架构"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地下氢能存储","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/underground-storage/underground-hydrogen-storage"},"next":{"title":"数字孪生与健康监测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/smart-operations-frontiers/digital-twin-monitoring"}}